notesT: A big "übersichtlicher / no duplicate paths" pass — one accessible way to everything,
  and your plugins finally all show up.
  UNIFY (no more doppelte Wege):
  • The header pulse tap now opens the Bio page (one bio home) instead of a separate
    fullscreen pulse screen.
  • ONE Stop: the transport bar's Stop now ends the whole take (music + bio session) — no
    second stop button needed. (To just watch your pulse without music, arm the body on the
    Bio page.)
  • Removed Compose's redundant bottom HUD — its Play/Visual/Tools all duplicated the
    transport bar, the header, and the Tools grid. Compose is cleaner now.
  • Entrainment lives only on the Bio page now (was duplicated in Compose too).
  • Arrange's empty screen now guides you: "Open Compose / Open Clips" — no dead end.
  PLUGINS:
  • You now see ALL your installed AUv3 instruments & effects, not just Apple's — the scan
    was one-time (stale) and now re-scans every time you open Plugins, with a Rescan button.
    Open any loaded plugin's own UI to tweak it inline.
